---
description: Public site vs admin design boundaries
globs: app/**/*,components/**/*,features/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Design Boundaries

- Public site: editorial, imagery-led, not default shadcn/dashboard look
- Admin: may use shadcn/Radix for accessibility and productivity
- Prefer semantic tokens over arbitrary Tailwind values
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- `/admin` is noindex and robots-denied
